.TH GODHCP 8 "2026" "GoDHCP 0.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
godhcp \- DHCPv4 server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B godhcp
[\fB\-config\fR \fIpath\fR]
[\fB\-validate\fR]
.PP
.B godhcp version
.PP
.B godhcp hash-password \-password
.I secret
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B godhcp
is a DHCPv4 server with YAML configuration, a REST API and an embedded web interface.
It answers clients on local VLAN interfaces and behind DHCP relays (option 82).
By default the DHCP socket binds to UDP port
.B 67
.RI ( server.listen ).
.SH WARNINGS
UDP port 67 is privileged. On Linux run as root or grant
.BR CAP_NET_BIND_SERVICE ,
.B CAP_NET_RAW
and
.BR CAP_NET_ADMIN .
In Docker use
.B --network host
together with
.B --cap-add=NET_ADMIN
and
.BR --cap-add=NET_RAW .
Changing
.I server.listen
to a high port is for local debugging only; production clients expect port 67.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-config \ path
Configuration file. The default is the
.I GODHCP_CONFIG
environment variable or
.IR configs/dev.yml .
.TP
.B \-validate
Load and validate the configuration, then exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B version
Print the version and copyright.
.TP
.B hash-password
Print an argon2id PHC hash suitable for
.IR api.auth.users .
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGHUP
Reload the configuration file without dropping the process.
.TP
.BR SIGINT ", " SIGTERM
Stop the HTTP API and the DHCP listener.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/godhcp/config.yml
Server configuration.
.TP
.I /var/lib/godhcp/leases.db
Default SQLite lease database.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project documentation in
.IR docs/ .
